ckground-color:#FF8C0020;color:#ffaf4d">Fighter</span></div></div><p class="text-xs text-text-muted mt-1 line-clamp-2">Tigreal has a favourable matchup against Kalea based on ranked data, so expect a win rate advantage in this matchup.</p></div><div class="flex-shrink-0 text-right"><p class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-lg sm:text-xl font-heading font-bold" style="color:#C8AA6E"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-down w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 17h6v-6"></path><path d="m22 17-8.5-8.5-5 5L2 7"></path></svg>+<!-- -->1.9</p><p class="text-[9px] text-text-muted uppercase hidden sm:block">win rate delta</p></div></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold/20 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/20 pointer-events-none"></div></div><div class="group relative bg-surface-3 border border-mlbb-gold/15 hover:border-mlbb-green/30 transition-all duration-300" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 sm:gap-4 sm:p-4"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-7 sm:w-8 text-center"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-heading font-bold text-text-accent">#<!-- -->7</span></div><a class="flex-shrink-0" href="/heroes/julian"><div class="relative overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 rounded-full" style="width:48px;height:48px;min-width:48px;background-color:#00AAFF12"><img alt="Julian hero icon" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_5511ddc0ad2789b525f32ef572b017eb.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_5511ddc0ad2789b525f32ef572b017eb.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_5511ddc0ad2789b525f32ef572b017eb.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></a><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 flex-wrap"><a class="min-w-0 max-w-full truncate font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-text-primary hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors" href="/heroes/julian">Julian</a><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-heading font-bold bg-gradient-to-br from-[#00AAFF] to-[#0077CC] text-[#00111a] shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(0,170,255,0.3)] w-6 h-6 text-xs animate-tier-pop">B</div><div class="gap-1.5 hidden sm:flex"><span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5" style="background-color:#00AAFF20;color:#4dc4ff">Assassin</span><span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5" style="background-color:#FF8C0020;color:#ffaf4d">Fighter</span></div></div><p class="text-xs text-text-muted mt-1 line-clamp-2">Tigreal has a favourable matchup against Julian based on ranked data, so expect a win rate advantage in this matchup.</p></div><div class="flex-shrink-0 text-right"><p class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-lg sm:text-xl font-heading font-bold" style="color:#C8AA6E"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-down w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 17h6v-6"></path><path d="m22 17-8.5-8.5-5 5L2 7"></path></svg>+<!-- -->1.7</p><p class="text-[9px] text-text-muted uppercase hidden sm:block">win rate delta</p></div></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold/20 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/20 pointer-events-none"></div></div></div></section></div><section class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3"><a class="block" href="/heroes/gord"><div class="h-full border border-mlbb-gold/18 bg-surface-2/82 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold-bright/35"><p class="mb-1 font-heading text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-text-accent">Official Ally Note</p><h3 class="font-heading text-base font-bold text-text-primary">Gord</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-text-muted">Tigreal put all the enemies together with his skill combination and gord with his stun and ultimate kills them all while Tigreal has all of them stunned. The most of the times my friend gets Triple Kill/Maniac and even once he reached Savage by doing this combo. A nice team.</p></div></a><a class="block" href="/heroes/miya"><div class="h-full border border-mlbb-gold/18 bg-surface-2/82 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold-bright/35"><p class="mb-1 font-heading text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-text-accent">Official Counter Note</p><h3 class="font-heading text-base font-bold text-text-primary">Miya</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-text-muted">The only mobility Miya has is her Ultimate, and it has a big cooldown, making Tigreal able to reach her while escaping by using Flicker and 2nd ability, and even only his 2nd would be enough.</p></div></a><a class="block" href="/heroes/eudora"><div class="h-full border border-mlbb-gold/18 bg-surface-2/82 p-4 transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold-bright/35"><p class="mb-1 font-heading text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-text-accent">Official Threat Note</p><h3 class="font-heading text-base font-bold text-text-primary">Eudora</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-text-muted">It is obvious why she is here, she has a stun that lasts enough to let the enemy team lower your hp faster if you don&#x27;t take care, Tigreal is pretty hard, but not inmortal like Argus with his Ulti. Keep an eye on it.</p></div></a></section><section><div class="mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock w-5 h-5 text-text-accent-bright" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg><h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-heading font-bold text-text-primary">Game Phase Analysis for<!-- --> <span style="color:#F0D060">Tigreal</span></h2></div><p class="text-xs text-text-muted max-w-2xl">Tigreal&#x27;s 10 measured matchups do not separate by match length: no phase leads the others by more than that sample can resolve. There is no single window where Tigreal drops off, so focus on consistent play and team coordination.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><div class="bg-surface-3 border border-mlbb-gold/15 p-4" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px)"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1"><span class="text-xs font-heading font-bold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">Early Game</span><span class="text-[10px] text-text-muted">0-10 min</span></div><p class="text-base font-heading font-bold mb-2" style="color:#9BA0B4">No measured separation</p><div class="w-full h-2 bg-surface-4 overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full" style="background-color:#9BA0B4;width:0px"></div></div></div><div class="bg-surface-3 border border-mlbb-gold/15 p-4" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px)"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1"><span class="text-xs font-heading font-bold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">Mid Game</span><span class="text-[10px] text-text-muted">10-16 min</span></div><p class="text-base font-heading font-bold mb-2" style="color:#9BA0B4">No measured separation</p><div class="w-full h-2 bg-surface-4 overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full" style="background-color:#9BA0B4;width:0px"></div></div></div><div class="bg-surface-3 border border-mlbb-gold/15 p-4" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px)"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1"><span class="text-xs font-heading font-bold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">Late Game</span><span class="text-[10px] text-text-muted">16+ min</span></div><p class="text-base font-heading font-bold mb-2" style="color:#9BA0B4">No measured separation</p><div class="w-full h-2 bg-surface-4 overflow-hidden"><div class="h-full" style="background-color:#9BA0B4;width:0px"></div></div></div></div><p class="text-[10px] text-text-muted/80 mt-3 max-w-3xl">Shape only, from the 10 matchups measured for Tigreal. The bars rank Tigreal&#x27;s own phases against each other, not against other heroes, and are not win rates.</p></section></div></div><div id="tabpanel-builds" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-builds" tabindex="0" hidden=""><section class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 xl:flex-row xl:items-end xl:justify-between xl:gap-8"><header class="min-w-0"><h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold uppercase leading-tight tracking-[0.06em] text-mlbb-text sm:text-2xl"><span class="text-mlbb-gold-bright">Tigreal</span> <span class="text-mlbb-text/85">Best Builds, Emblems</span> <span class="text-mlbb-text/60">&amp;</span> <span class="text-mlbb-text/85">Talents</span></h2><p class="mt-1 hidden max-w-3xl text-sm text-mlbb-text-secondary sm:block xl:hidden">Three battle-tested loadouts. Pick the one that fits the draft, not the one with the most flash.</p><div class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1"><span class="font-heading text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-text-muted">Patch <!-- -->2.1.67</span><span title="These loadouts were last re-read on patch 2.1.67; the live patch is 2.2.16a. Item stats may have changed." class="inline-flex flex-shrink-0 items-center gap-1 border border-amber-400/25 bg-amber-400/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-heading text-[9px] font-bold uppercase leading-none tracking-[0.1em] text-amber-300/90"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-history h-2.5 w-2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path><path d="M12 7v5l4 2"></path></svg>Older patch</span><span class="font-heading text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-text-accent/70">Reviewed May 13, 2026</span></div></header><div role="tablist" aria-label="Builds" class="grid gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 xl:w-[620px] xl:shrink-0" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr))"><button type="button" role="tab" id="build-tab-1" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="build-1" class="relative flex min-h-[44px] min-w-0 cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 border px-2 py-1.5 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-mlbb-gold sm:px-3 sm:py-2 border-mlbb-gold-bright/60 bg-mlbb-gold/10"><span class="font-heading text-[11px] font-bold tabular-nums sm:text-xs text-text-accent-bright" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span class="min-w-0 font-heading text-[10px] font-bold uppercase leading-tight tracking-wide line-clamp-3 sm:line-clamp-2 sm:text-xs text-mlbb-text">Roam Conceal Flicker Pickoff</span></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="build-tab-2" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="build-2" class="relative flex min-h-[44px] min-w-0 cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 border px-2 py-1.5 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-mlbb-gold sm:px-3 sm:py-2 border-mlbb-gold/18 bg-surface-2/70 hover:border-mlbb-gold/40"><span class="font-heading text-[11px] font-bold tabular-nums sm:text-xs text-text-accent/70" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span class="min-w-0 font-heading text-[10px] font-bold uppercase leading-tight tracking-wide line-clamp-3 sm:line-clamp-2 sm:text-xs text-mlbb-text-secondary">Roam Frontline Encourage</span></button><button type="button" role="tab" id="build-tab-3" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="build-3" class="relative flex min-h-[44px] min-w-0 cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 border px-2 py-1.5 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-mlbb-gold sm:px-3 sm:py-2 border-mlbb-gold/18 bg-surface-2/70 hover:border-mlbb-gold/40"><span class="font-heading text-[11px] font-bold tabular-nums sm:text-xs text-text-accent/70" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span class="min-w-0 font-heading text-[10px] font-bold uppercase leading-tight tracking-wide line-clamp-3 sm:line-clamp-2 sm:text-xs text-mlbb-text-secondary">Roam Anti-Physical Peel</span></button></div></div><article id="build-1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="build-tab-1" class="group/build relative overflow-hidden border border-mlbb-gold/22 bg-surface-2/92 scroll-mt-24" style="box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04) inset, 0 30px 60px -36px rgba(0,0,0,0.95);opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.06] hex-pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-mlbb-gold-bright/80 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[3px] bg-gradient-to-b from-mlbb-gold-bright/70 via-mlbb-gold/30 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full blur-3xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover/build:opacity-90" aria-hidden="true" style="background-color:#2ECC711f"></div><span class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-4 top-2 font-heading text-[140px] font-black leading-none text-text-accent-bright/[0.04] sm:-right-2 sm:top-0 sm:text-[180px]" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div class="relative p-4 sm:p-5"><header class="mb-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:items-start sm:justify-between"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold uppercase leading-tight tracking-[0.04em] text-mlbb-text sm:text-2xl">Roam Conceal Flicker Pickoff</h3><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-2xl text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary sm:text-sm xl:max-w-none">Default ranked setup for hiding Tigreal&#x27;s entry angle, chaining Conceal with Flicker, and resetting faster when a pick turns into an assist.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 sm:shrink-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-gold-bright/35 bg-gradient-to-br from-mlbb-gold-bright/12 to-mlbb-gold-bright/2 px-3 py-1.5"><span class="font-heading text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-text-accent/85">Cost</span><span class="font-heading text-[13px] font-bold tracking-wide text-text-accent-bright">11,250<!-- -->g</span></div><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-blue/35 bg-gradient-to-br from-mlbb-blue/14 to-mlbb-blue/3 px-3 py-1.5 font-heading text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-mlbb-blue-light transition-all duration-200 hover:border-mlbb-blue-light/60 hover:bg-mlbb-blue/20 hover:text-[#9fdcff]" href="/build-simulator?hero=tigreal&amp;items=rapid-boots%2Cdominance-ice%2Cfleeting-time%2Cathenas-shield%2Cantique-cuirass%2Cimmortality&amp;blessing=conceal&amp;spell=flicker&amp;emblem=support&amp;talents=agility%2Cpull-yourself-together%2Cfocusing-mark&amp;flex=tough-boots.rapid-boots%2Cradiant-armor.athenas-shield%2Cguardian-helmet.fleeting-time">Simulator<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" 