o earned his knighthood through unmatched valor on the battlefield of the Crimson Banner War. His shield has never broken, and his charge has never faltered, making him the living symbol of Moniyan courage. Tigreal leads from the front, believing that a true leader must be the first into danger and the last to retreat.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"rafaela\",\"heroName\":\"Rafaela\",\"relationship\":\"Divine healer who supports Moniyan's defenders\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"granger\",\"heroName\":\"Granger\",\"relationship\":\"Fellow Moniyan champion and trusted comrade\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"lancelot\",\"heroName\":\"Lancelot\",\"relationship\":\"Noble knight serving the Moniyan cause\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"dyrroth\",\"heroName\":\"Dyrroth\",\"relationship\":\"Abyssal prince and sworn enemy of Moniyan\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"yu-zhong\",\"heroName\":\"Yu Zhong\",\"relationship\":\"Dragon Lord whose ambition threatens the empire\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"Tigreal\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":45.71,\"pickRate\":1.92,\"banRate\":7.98},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":45.67,\"pickRate\":1.93,\"banRate\":7.89},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":45.54,\"pickRate\":1.89,\"banRate\":7.5},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":43.89,\"pickRate\":1.84,\"banRate\":4.96},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":43.99,\"pickRate\":1.84,\"banRate\":5.17},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":44.36,\"pickRate\":1.86,\"banRate\":5.59},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":44.79,\"pickRate\":2.01,\"banRate\":6}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"roles\":\"$60:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$60:props:hero:lane\",\"difficulty\":1,\"winRate\":44.79,\"pickRate\":2.01,\"banRate\":6,\"curatedBuilds\":\"$60:props:curatedBuilds\",\"topCounters\":\"$60:props:tabData:counterData:countersThisHero\",\"hasCounterPage\":true,\"hasRankStats\":true,\"loca