6 xl:gap-x-8 lg:items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"lg:order-2 lg:sticky lg:self-start\",\"style\":{\"top\":128},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L7d\",null,{\"target\":\"#hero-article\"}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"hero-article\",\"className\":\"relative lg:order-1 bg-[#0a0a0a]/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#C8AA6E]/15 p-5 md:p-9 overflow-hidden\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -24px rgba(0,0,0,0.8)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#F0D060]/55 to-transparent\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-[#F0D060]/40\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute -top-32 -right-24 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-[#C8AA6E]/[0.05] blur-3xl pointer-events-none\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hero-article-body max-w-[860px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[[[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"The lobbies where Tigreal is actually correct\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Tigreal is strongest in drafts that still respect tight terrain and grouped backlines. If the enemy mid and marksman both need to stand still to deal damage, if their jungle pathing runs through predictable choke points, and if their team lacks a clean answer to AoE engage, Tigreal is still one of the simplest ways to force a winning 5v5.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"That is the real pick condition. You are not drafting him because he is generically tanky. You are drafting him because the enemy team has to walk through river mouths, turtle ramps, or jungle entrances where Sacred Hammer plus Implosion can catch two priority targets at once. A Tigreal that only ever reaches the enemy tank has missed the point of the hero.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The trap drafts are obvious once you stop looking at his highlight clips. Diggie invalidates the first engage unless his ultimate is already gone. Kaja and Chou can counter-initiate and remove Tigreal before the combo finishes. Hilda makes the early map miserable because she rotates faster, hits harder at level 1, and punishes passive brush control. When two of those answers show up together, Tigreal stops being a playmaker and starts being a cooldown check the enemy is happy to pass.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"He is best when your own damage profile is immediate. Aurora, Vale, Xavier, Odette, and any jungler that can burst a clumped backline make his engage worth the risk. He is much worse when your team needs six seconds of free hitting to cash the combo in. Tigreal buys a window, not a whole fight. Patch 2.1.88 (\",\"$L7e\",\") leaned into exactly this by trading some of his late-game bulk for early durability, so that window is now widest through the first two thirds of the game and narrowest once the enemy carries are fully itemized.\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$L7f\",\"\\n\",\"$L80\",\"\\n\",\"$L81\",\"\\n\",\"$L82\",\"\\n\",\"$L83\",\"\\n\",\"$L84\",\"\\n\",\"$L85\",\"\\n\",\"$L86\",\"\\n\",\"$L87\",\"\\n\",\"$L88\",\"\\n\",\"$L89\",\"\\n\",\"$L8a\",\"\\n\",\"$L8b\"],\"$L8c\",\"$L8d\"],\"$L8e\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a6:I[392015,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\nb5:I[131354,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\n6d:[\"$\",\"$L6a\",\"gatotkaca\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/gatotkaca\",\"className\":\"group block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-4 border border-mlbb-gold/20 overflow-hidden card-hover hover:border-mlbb-gold/50\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative w-14 h-14 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-surface-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6b\",null,{\"src\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_96f9dbbc096e0f0a28f9b9e587d06a9c.png\",\"alt\":\"Gatotkaca - Mighty Legend\",\"unoptimized\":false,\"priority\":\"$undefined\",\"fetchPriority\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"className\":\"object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\",\"sizes\":\"56px\",\"placeholder\":\"blur\",\"blurDataURL\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMTAwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj48cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iMTAwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCIgZmlsbD0iIzBkMTIyNSIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading font-bold text-text-primary group-hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors truncate\",\"children\":\"Gatotkaca\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-0